# Cephalid Inkmage: "When this creature enters, surveil 3" (CR 701.25a). Bot1 puts the Swamp into its graveyard and keeps the Plains and the Island
# on top, Plains first: the turn-3 draw is the Plains, the turn-5 draw the Island. Two cards in the graveyard (the Swamp and Black Lotus) are far from
# threshold, so Bot2's Memnite may block it (and dies). Bot2, which plays no land, discards an Island to its hand size.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Cephalid Inkmage
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Island
Swamp
Plains
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Cephalid Inkmage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Plains; Island | Swamp)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp; Black Lotus
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Plains
Bot1.Attack(Cephalid Inkmage > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Cephalid Inkmage)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Plains; Island
Bot2.Graveyard = Island; Memnite
Bot2.Life = 20
